s have a steady flow of interactions, while others trigger massive spikes (like outbound sales campaigns or a rise in customer service requests) that can generate thousands of concurrent calls.\"}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"This load variability makes traditional database provisioning very inefficient. For this reason, Vapi turned to \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/home\",\"children\":\"Neon\"}],\" (serverless Postgres) to support their workload.\"]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"autoscaling-for-spiky-workloads\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Autoscaling for spiky workloads\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#autoscaling-for-spiky-workloads\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Autoscaling for spiky workloads\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3\",\"children\":\"$61:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n71:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Neon now powers all of Vapi’s business-critical Postgres workloads. While Vapi’s database workload is primarily read-driven, write operations spike in real time as calls are processed. Call metadata—such as events, status updates, and token usage—is written to Neon instantly. The database scales up when demand surges and scales down when traffic dips.\"}]\n72:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Vapi migrated from Supabase to Neon for exactly this reason: real-time\"}],\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/docs/introduction/autoscaling\",\"children\":\"autoscaling\"}],\". With Neon’s serverless architecture and compute and storage autoscaling, the Vapi team no longer has to worry about overprovisioning or hitting performance ceilings.\"]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"blockquote\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"chi"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ldren\":[\"“Database migrations are always a headache, but the Neon team made it a smooth process. Their support helped us troubleshoot performance issues and get everything running fast” (\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tejas-siripurapu-7b7b81105/overlay/about-this-profile/\",\"children\":\"Tejas Siripurapu\"}],\", Founding Engineer at \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vapi.ai/?utm_source=partner\u0026utm_campaign=neon-web\u0026utm_term=neon\u0026utm_medium=neon-web\u0026utm_content=blog\",\"children\":\"Vapi.ai\"}],\")\"]}]}]}]\n74:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"reliable-connection-pooling\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Reliable connection pooling\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#reliable-connection-pooling\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Reliable connection pooling\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3\",\"children\":\"$61:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Connection pooling is critical for Vapi. To efficiently manage their thousands of concurrent voice interactions, Vapi uses Neon’s \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/docs/connect/connection-pooling\",\"children\":\"connection pooler\"}],\", built on PgBouncer. Like all resources in Neon, concurrent connections scale automatically with load: as compute autoscales up and down, the pooler adjusts dynamically, supporting up to 10,000 concurrent calls.\"]}]\n76:[\"$\",\"blockquote\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":[\"“We love that Neon just uses PgBouncer under the hood—no unexpected behavior, no surprises. It keeps our database connections stable, even under heavy load” (\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tejas-siripurapu-7b7b81105/overlay/about-this-profile/\",\"children\":\"Tejas Siripurapu\"}],\", Founding Engineer at \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vapi.ai/?utm_source=partner\u0026utm_campaign=neon-web\u0026utm_term=neon\u0026utm_medium=neon-web\u0026utm_content=blog\",\"children\":\"Vapi.ai\"}],\")\"]}]}]}]\n77:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"streaming-replication-to-clickhouse-via-peerdb\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Streaming replication to ClickHouse via PeerDB\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#streaming-replication-to-clickhouse-via-peerdb\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Streaming replication to ClickHouse via PeerDB\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3\",\"children\":\"$61:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Postgres isn’t the only data store in Vapi’s stack. To support log analysis and reporting, \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/blog/postgres-meets-analytics-cdc-from-neon-to-clickhouse-via-peerdb\",\"children\":\"Vapi streams data from Neon to ClickHouse via PeerDB\"}],\".\"]}]\n79:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Some logs are written directly to ClickHouse, while others pass through Neon first before being replicated. This setup allows Vapi to correlate structured call data with raw logs, providing a more comprehensive view of interactions.\"}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"start-building\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Start building\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"clas"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"sName\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#start-building\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Start building\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$61:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n7b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Vapi makes it easy to add real-time voice AI to your apps. \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://vapi.ai/?utm_source=partner\u0026utm_campaign=neon-web\u0026utm_term=neon\u0026utm_medium=neon-web\u0026utm_content=blog\",\"children\":\"Try it out\"}],\" and share what you build on \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://x.com/vapi_ai\",\"children\":\"X\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/vapi-ai/\",\"children\":\"Linkedin\"}],\".\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none b